  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Gary Ball is a Canadian businessman and co-owner of Medical Data Systems, a Florida hospital receivables company. He joined as partner, chairman and chief financial officer in 1997, before its expansion beyond the southeastern United States. The business provides debt collection, billing support and assistance when hospitals change accounting systems.",
